  "fieldEventBody": "Press only when the vehicle is fully stopped, by a passenger or by an operator who is parked. Events share one timeline with the raw OBD data, and an immediate save is attempted.",
  "@fieldEventBody": {
    "description": "Safety copy. 'attempted' is load-bearing: the save can fail, and fieldEventMemoryOnly is what the user sees when it does."
